OL,3,GNEWSANew life for dog rescued from
OL,4,Ahouse with 83 others
OL,5,
OL,6,FA springer spaniel who was one of 84
OL,7,Fdogs living in "squalid conditions" in
OL,8,Fa family home has been given a second
OL,9,Fchance at life.
OL,11,FKaty was discovered at a property in
OL,12,FDoncaster in April last year, where
OL,13,Fanimals covered in faeces and urine had
OL,14,Fbeen left to breed by themselves.
OL,16,FRSPCA officers executing a warrant at
OL,17,Fthe rural cottage in Tickhill described
OL,18,Fthe conditions as "the worst they had
OL,19,Fencountered during their careers".
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
