OL,3,GNEWSANew life for dog rescued from
OL,4,Ahouse with 83 others
OL,5,
OL,6,FKaty has since been adopted by Wendy
OL,7,Fand Lindsay Cann, from Cowley in North
OL,8,FYorkshire, who said she had "come along
OL,9,Fat the right time".
